/S /H4
/P 39 0 R
/T (KARNA is an environmental sound awareness system intended to help deaf and hard-of-hearing users become aware of important sounds around them. The prototype converts an audio input into a machine-learning prediction and then translates the detected sound category into a corresponding haptic pulse pattern.)
/E (KARNA is an environmental sound awareness system intended to help deaf and hard-of-hearing users become aware of important sounds around them. The prototype converts an audio input into a machine-learning prediction and then translates the detected sound category into a corresponding haptic pulse pattern.)
