/T (The mono model achieved 75.13% validation accuracy with a macro F1-score of 67.20%. On the clean test dataset, it achieved 61.11% accuracy and a macro F1-score of 41.85%. Under noisy test conditions, its accuracy was 52.38%, with an emergency-class macro F1-score of 36.09%.)
/E (The mono model achieved 75.13% validation accuracy with a macro F1-score of 67.20%. On the clean test dataset, it achieved 61.11% accuracy and a macro F1-score of 41.85%. Under noisy test conditions, its accuracy was 52.38%, with an emergency-class macro F1-score of 36.09%.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
