/P 41 0 R
/T (The stereo model achieved 74.62% validation accuracy with a macro F1-score of 66.49%. On the clean test dataset, it achieved 61.11% accuracy and a macro F1-score of 42.49%. Under noisy test conditions, it achieved 54.17% accuracy, with an emergency-class macro F1-score of 39.66%.)
/E (The stereo model achieved 74.62% validation accuracy with a macro F1-score of 66.49%. On the clean test dataset, it achieved 61.11% accuracy and a macro F1-score of 42.49%. Under noisy test conditions, it achieved 54.17% accuracy, with an emergency-class macro F1-score of 39.66%.)
